(CSR Directive Implementation Act)', 'This document outlines the draft law to strengthen non-financial reporting by companies and their management and group management reports.', 'This document outlines the draft law to strengthen non-financial reporting by companies and their management and group management reports.', 'This document outlines the draft law to strengthen non-financial reporting by companies and their management and group management reports.', 'Germany', 'climate', 'in_force', '2016-01-01'::date, 'Germany', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/63_37', ARRAY['mandatory', 'other sustainability policy', 'germany', 'regulations']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('e98b3925-a3eb-57b3-91f4-4aa5d22765b1', 'Germany National Action Plan Implementation of the UN Guiding', 'National Action Plan Implementation of the UN Guiding Principles for Business and Human Rights', 'The Action Plan is intended to launch a process of creating a road map for the practical implementation of the Guiding Principles. Its aim is to pool the capacities of the various players from government, business, civil society and trade unions, particularly with a view to contributing actively to improving the human rights situation throughout supply and value chains in Germany and worldwide.', 'The Action Plan is intended to launch a process of creating a road map for the practical implementation of the Guiding Principles. Its aim is to pool the capacities of the various players from government, business, civil society and trade unions, particularly with a view to contributing actively to improving the human rights situation throughout supply and value chains in Germany and worldwide.', 'The Action Plan is intended to launch a process of creating a road map for the practical implementation of the Guiding Principles. Its aim is to pool the capacities of the various players from government, business, civil society and trade unions, particularly with a view to contributing actively to improving the human rights situation throughout supply and value chains in Germany and worldwide.', 'Germany', 'governance', 'in_force', '2016-01-01'::date, 'Germany', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/63_5', ARRAY['other sustainability policy', 'germany', 'regulations', 'sdg11', 'sdg16', 'voluntary']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
